  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Add a button to restart the game quickly next to the button to quit the game in the QM would be interesting, it would be faster to restart the game especially when we want to remove a bug, latencies or just restart the game.\nSo, also add a restart button next to the quit button in the normal menu would be perhaps to think about.\nThanks :)",
